@startuml FastBite_State_Delivery
title FastBite - Estados de Entrega (DeliveryStatus)

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> PENDING : createDeliveryForOrder

PENDING --> PICKED_UP : markDeliveryPickedUp\nDELIVERY_PICKED_UP
PENDING --> FAILED : markDeliveryFailed/System\nDELIVERY_FAILED

PICKED_UP --> IN_TRANSIT : markDeliveryInTransit\nDELIVERY_IN_TRANSIT
PICKED_UP --> FAILED : markDeliveryFailed/System\nDELIVERY_FAILED

IN_TRANSIT --> DELIVERED : markDeliveryDelivered\nDELIVERY_DELIVERED
IN_TRANSIT --> FAILED : markDeliveryFailed/System\nDELIVERY_FAILED

DELIVERED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  A atribuicao do estafeta e feita por delivery_offers.
  Aceitar oferta preenche courier_id e marca o estafeta BUSY.
end note

@enduml
